From 3890ef6d5d74b3f197e33f5805714e72f71ba905 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: ryoma-89 <ryoma-89@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 22 Nov 2026 18:35:08 +0900
Subject: [PATCH] velox: forward ray tracing pipelines (patch 0012)

vkCreateRayTracingPipelinesKHR is created synchronously on the host (deferred
operations stay in the guest), pipeline libraries and capture/replay are
rejected, capture/replay handle pointers are cleared, and pipelines are boxed
and tracked like compute pipelines. Shader group handle capture/replay
features are masked. Generated host code applies only the generator diff.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Change-Id: I45065c31090adc99f01609375058d075fc8043e0
